/-!
Entropy/Cardy certification boundary for the Mock1 advanced registry.

This layer deliberately separates analytic paper input from finite Lean
checking.  Rademacher asymptotics, tail estimates, and cross-cusp transport are
carried as proof fields.  The concrete instance fills the numerical part with
rational intervals extracted from the paper's Table 6 and Theorem I.8.
-/

