/-!
Exact coefficient and central L-value boundary for the Mock1 advanced layer.

The analytic inputs from Section K are represented by proof-carrying
certificates.  The reference object below is a concrete, unconditional Lean
instance of the certificate interface: every field is filled by an explicit
term, while paper-specific analytic theorems remain data carried by the
corresponding proof fields.
-/

def referenceExactCoefficient : Nat -> Real :=
  fun _ => 1

def referenceExactScalarPart : Nat -> Real :=
  fun _ => 1

def referenceExactThetaPart : Nat -> Real :=
  fun _ => 0

