/-!
H-stage paper instance completion layer.

The first end-to-end instance is the depth-one T5 scalar channel.  The records
below collect the named registry, concrete theorem extraction, paper object
family data, T1-T5 fields, SPT/CRT gates, p-adic Lemma 9/I.3-I.5 data, and
Rademacher/entropy/regression fields into a single certificate.
-/

inductive PaperInstancesHRequirement where
  | namedInstanceRegistry
  | depthOneConcreteTheoremExtraction
  | paperObjectFamilySelection
  | weightLevelQShiftCuspPrincipalData
  | t1t5CertificateFields
  | sptPrimeGatesAndCrtPortfolio
  | padicLemmaPortfolio
  | rademacherEntropyRegressionInstance
  | finalConcreteCertificateTheorem
  | oneObjectEndToEnd
deriving DecidableEq, Repr

