Paper Item I.2 concrete finite p-adic data.

The paper's worked run fixes `p = 5`, `k = 2`, `M = 50`, and `N = 5`.
The normalized values modulo 25 are
`[1, 5, 12, 8, 15, 0]`, and the Mahler coefficients are
`[1, 4, 3, 11, 11, 9]`. This section certifies those finite statements
directly. The extrapolated Mahler values are recorded separately; they are
not identified with analytic tail coefficients.
-/

