Microlocal certification-readiness endpoint.

This endpoint is the PR-facing aggregation layer for the advanced checklist:
it keeps the unconditional readiness certificate, final synthesis, actual input
matrix, actual-input microlocal formulas, RLF microlocal mathematics, explicit
RLF formulas, explicit T1-T5 formulas, explicit SPT formulas, explicit Kernel
formulas, the reduced and full 11-by-22 T1-T2 finite inputs, the exact T3
three-block portfolio, Ramanujan `f` finite coefficients,
the finite/analytic Exact split with the paper K input/unit-model audit, the
T1-T5 Appell-Lerch/unary-theta finite split, the paper's Item I.2 finite
p-adic data,
the actual `p = 5` SPT arithmetic, the declared model and paper Item 1
Kernel/Cusp/Multiplier inputs with parity/power audits, the Table 6 rational
entropy diagnostics, the Ramanujan/T3 three-block and three-cusp coverage
audit, the proof-carrying Ramanujan ninety-row regression constructor, an
actual Ramanujan shifted-q-series/Appell-Lerch analytic constructor, an
actual Ramanujan coefficient/L-value/local-Euler constructor, an exhaustive
evidence-class
audit, section atom projections, formula atomic matrix, and final aggregation
in one auditable structure.
-/

